  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #1a1a2e;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #16213e;\n  border: 4px solid #0f3460;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f3460;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n}\n\n.title {\n  color: #e94560;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  color: #e94560;\n  font-size: 64px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: 4px solid #e94560;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 80px;\n  background: #e94560;\n  color: #16213e;\n  border: 3px solid #0f3460;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0f3460;\n  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #ff6b81;\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #e94560;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #0f3460;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 48px;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    min-width: 70px;\n  }\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var count = 0;\n  var countEl = document.getElementById('count');\n  var increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\n  var decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\n  var resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\n  function updateDisplay() {\n    countEl.textContent = String(count);\n  }\n\n  increaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count += 1;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  decreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count -= 1;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count = 0;\n    updateDisplay();\n  });\n\n  updateDisplay();\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA dependency-free, offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Starts at **0** and supports negative numbers.\n- Three labeled buttons:\n  - **+1** (`id=\"increase\"`) — adds one.\n  - **-1** (`id=\"decrease\"`) — subtracts one.\n  - **Reset** (`id=\"reset\"`) — resets to zero.\n- Output element with `id=\"count\"` shows the current integer.\n- Fully keyboard-accessible with visible focus states.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server, network, or storage required.\n\nClick the buttons or use Tab to focus and Enter/Space to activate them.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure.\n- `styles.css` — pixel-themed styling.\n- `script.js` — counter logic.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have descriptive `aria-label` attributes.\n- The `#count` element uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` for screen reader announcements.\n- Focus indicators are clearly visible.\n\n## License\n\nPublic domain.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
